    "custom_liquid_LxwRcf": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "Custom Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "full_width": true,
        "remove_vertical_spacing": false,
        "remove_horizontal_spacing": false,
        "liquid": "<div class=\"gwa\">\n  <h2 class=\"gwa-title\">Ils l'ont adopté, et ils le disent mieux que nous</h2>\n\n  <!-- ⚠️ AVIS DE TEST — À REMPLACER PAR DE VRAIS AVIS CLIENTS AVANT MISE EN LIGNE ⚠️ -->\n  <div class=\"gwa-grid\">\n\n    <!-- 1 · FEMME · LYON -->\n    <article class=\"gwa-card\">\n      <img class=\"gwa-photo\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0980/1724/7556/files/ChatGPT_Image_13_sept._2026_17_19_32.png?v=1789313291\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"gwa-panel\">\n        <div class=\"gwa-stars\" aria-label=\"5 sur 5\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3>« On sent le 350 g direct »</h3>\n        <p>Rien à voir avec les tee-shirts fins que j'avais avant. Il a du corps, il tombe bien, et il ne se déforme pas au lavage.</p>\n        <div class=\"gwa-who\">\n          <img class=\"gwa-av\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0980/1724/7556/files/ChatGPT_Image_13_sept._2026_17_19_32.png?v=1789313291\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <div><strong>Léa</strong><em>Lyon</em></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <!-- 2 · HOMME · LILLE -->\n    <article class=\"gwa-card\">\n      <img class=\"gwa-photo\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0980/1724/7556/files/ChatGPT_Image_13_sept._2026_17_19_32.png?v=1789313291\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"gwa-panel\">\n        <div class=\"gwa-stars\" aria-label=\"5 sur 5\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3>« J'ai pris ma taille habituelle »</h3>\n        <p>J'hésitais à commander en ligne pour un oversize. Le guide des tailles était clair, la coupe est exactement comme sur les photos.</p>\n        <div class=\"gwa-who\">\n          <img class=\"gwa-av\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0980/1724/7556/files/ChatGPT_Image_13_sept._2026_17_19_32.png?v=1789313291\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <div><strong>Mehdi</strong><em>Lille</em></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <!-- 3 · FEMME · MARSEILLE -->\n    <article class=\"gwa-card\">\n      <img class=\"gwa-photo\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0980/1724/7556/files/ChatGPT_Image_13_sept._2026_17_19_32.png?v=1789313291\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"gwa-panel\">\n        <div class=\"gwa-stars\" aria-label=\"5 sur 5\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3>« Enfin une marque qui raconte un truc »</h3>\n        <p>J'en avais marre des logos que tout le monde porte. Là il y a une histoire derrière, et ça change tout quand on me demande d'où il vient.</p>\n        <div class=\"gwa-who\">\n          <img class=\"gwa-av\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0980/1724/7556/files/ChatGPT_Image_13_sept._2026_17_19_32.png?v=1789313291\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <div><strong>Camille</strong><em>Marseille</em></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <!-- 4 · HOMME · TOULOUSE -->\n    <article class=\"gwa-card\">\n      <img class=\"gwa-photo\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0980/1724/7556/files/ChatGPT_Image_13_sept._2026_17_19_32.png?v=1789313291\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"gwa-panel\">\n        <div class=\"gwa-stars\" aria-label=\"5 sur 5\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3>« Le flocage n'a pas bougé »</h3>\n        <p>Une dizaine de lavages et il est comme au premier jour. Pas de craquelure, pas de décoloration. C'est ça que je voulais vérifier.</p>\n        <div class=\"gwa-who\">\n          <img class=\"gwa-av\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0980/1724/7556/files/ChatGPT_Image_13_sept._2026_17_19_32.png?v=1789313291\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <div><strong>Thomas</strong><em>Toulouse</em></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <!-- 5 · FEMME · NANTES -->\n    <article class=\"gwa-card\">\n      <img class=\"gwa-photo\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0980/1724/7556/files/ChatGPT_Image_13_sept._2026_17_19_32.png?v=1789313291\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"gwa-panel\">\n        <div class=\"gwa-stars\" aria-label=\"5 sur 5\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3>« Commandé lundi, reçu mercredi »</h3>\n        <p>Livraison rapide et suivi dès l'expédition. Le colis était soigné, on sent que ce n'est pas de la vente à la chaîne.</p>\n        <div class=\"gwa-who\">\n          <img class=\"gwa-av\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0980/1724/7556/files/ChatGPT_Image_13_sept._2026_17_19_32.png?v=1789313291\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <div><strong>Inès</strong><em>Nantes</em></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <!-- 6 · HOMME · STRASBOURG -->\n    <article class=\"gwa-card\">\n      <img class=\"gwa-photo\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0980/1724/7556/files/ChatGPT_Image_13_sept._2026_17_19_32.png?v=1789313291\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"gwa-panel\">\n        <div class=\"gwa-stars\" aria-label=\"5 sur 5\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3>« Je suis pas de Grigny, et alors ? »</h3>\n        <p>J'ai hésité en me disant que c'était réservé à ceux du coin. En fait pas du tout. Le message parle à tout le monde, et je le porte fier.</p>\n        <div class=\"gwa-who\">\n          <img class=\"gwa-av\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0980/1724/7556/files/ChatGPT_Image_13_sept._2026_17_19_32.png?v=1789313291\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <div><strong>Samir</strong><em>Strasbourg</em></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:ital,wght@0,600;0,700;1,900&display=swap');\n\n.gwa{\n  /* ================= RÉGLAGES ================= */\n  --gw-orange:#F5C518;\n  --gw-ink:#111111;\n  --gw-bg:#FFFFFF;\n  --gw-photo-bg:#FFFFFF;\n  --gw-border:2px;\n  --gw-max:1760px;\n  --gw-card-w:82vw;        /* largeur d'une carte en défilement mobile */\n  /* ============================================ */\n\n  background:var(--gw-bg);\n  color:var(--gw-ink);\n  padding:60px 24px 68px;\n  box-sizing:border-box;\n  font-family:'Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif;\n}\n\n/* GRAND TITRE DE SECTION — standard commun à tout le site. */\n.gwa-title{\n  font-weight:900;font-style:italic;text-transform:uppercase;\n  text-align:center;color:var(--gw-ink);\n  font-size:clamp(22px,3.4vw,38px);\n  line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-0.015em;\n  margin:0 0 46px;\n}\n\n.gwa-grid{\n  display:grid;\n  grid-template-columns:1fr;\n  gap:22px;\n  max-width:var(--gw-max);\n  margin:0 auto;\n}\n\n.gwa-card{\n  display:flex;\n  border:var(--gw-border) solid var(--gw-ink);\n  background:var(--gw-orange);\n  overflow:hidden;\n}\n\n/* --- grande photo : image entière, jamais recadrée --- */\n.gwa-photo{\n  flex:0 0 40%;\n  width:40%;\n  align-self:stretch;\n  min-height:280px;\n  object-fit:contain;\n  object-position:center;\n  display:block;\n  background:var(--gw-photo-bg);\n  border-right:var(--gw-border) solid var(--gw-ink);\n  padding:10px;\n  box-sizing:border-box;\n}\n\n/* --- panneau texte --- */\n.gwa-panel{\n  flex:1;\n  min-width:0;\n  padding:24px 26px;\n  display:flex;flex-direction:column;\n  box-sizing:border-box;\n}\n\n.gwa-stars{display:flex;gap:3px;margin-bottom:14px;}\n.gwa-stars svg{width:19px;height:19px;fill:var(--gw-ink);}\n\n.gwa-panel h3{\n  margin:0 0 12px;\n  font-weight:900;font-style:italic;text-transform:uppercase;\n  font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,22px);\n  line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.015em;\n}\n.gwa-panel p{\n  margin:0 0 22px;\n  font-weight:600;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;\n}\n\n.gwa-who{\n  margin-top:auto;\n  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\n}\n.gwa-av{\n  flex:0 0 auto;\n  width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;\n  object-fit:contain;\n  background:var(--gw-photo-bg);\n  border:2px solid var(--gw-ink);\n  display:block;\n  padding:3px;\n  box-sizing:border-box;\n}\n\n.gwa-who strong{\n  display:block;\n  font-weight:900;font-style:italic;text-transform:uppercase;\n  font-size:16px;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\n}\n.gwa-who em{\n  display:block;font-style:normal;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;\n}\n\n/* --- DESKTOP : 3 colonnes larges, 2 rangées --- */\n@media(min-width:1000px){\n  .gwa-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:28px;}\n  .gwa-panel{padding:26px 30px;}\n}\n\n/* --- TABLETTE : 2 colonnes --- */\n@media(min-width:700px) and (max-width:999px){\n  .gwa-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}\n}\n\n/* --- MOBILE : défilement latéral --- */\n@media(max-width:699px){\n  .gwa{\n    padding:44px 0 50px;\n    width:100vw;max-width:100vw;\n    margin-left:calc(50% - 50vw);\n    margin-right:calc(50% - 50vw);\n  }\n  .gwa-title{margin:0 20px 30px;}\n\n  .gwa-grid{\n    display:flex;\n    flex-direction:row;\n    gap:14px;\n    max-width:none;\n    padding:0 16px;\n    overflow-x:auto;\n    overflow-y:hidden;\n    scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;\n    -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\n    scrollbar-width:none;\n  }\n  .gwa-grid::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none;}\n\n  .gwa-card{\n    flex:0 0 var(--gw-card-w);\n    scroll-snap-align:center;\n    flex-direction:column;\n  }\n  .gwa-photo{\n    flex:0 0 auto;width:100%;height:230px;min-height:0;\n    border-right:none;\n    border-bottom:var(--gw-border) solid var(--gw-ink);\n  }\n  .gwa-panel{padding:20px;}\n}\n</style>",
